#: src/AgentX/chat/PlanPanel.jsx:220
msgid "Making plan adjustments"
msgstr "Правлю план"

#. translators: Reason shown under the name of one of the user's unsaved edits that the AI Agent couldn't apply again: the block that edit changed was itself changed or removed elsewhere, so the agent can't find it.
#: public/build/extendify-agentx-5123061faaccc9af69d5.js:1225
#: src/AgentX/chat/ResolveChanges.jsx:20
msgid "Couldn't find the block as it was before this edit."
